{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A neo-noir tale set in a 2005 city of crime, following one demon\u2019s final shot at redemption and the people who follow blindly in his wake, only to learn that sometimes the Hellbound can\u2019t be redeemed.\u00a0When every sin gets written into the ledger, where does the fun end\u2026 and the fallout begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As old debts come due, retired mob boss Zyne is pulled back into the underworld of Baratrum City. He builds a crew that sees crime as a thrill, unaware of the guilt already on his name, and the consequences waiting in his shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the city closes in, the Otherworlders are forced to confront what they inherit by following a legend carved in blood. In a place where crime is routine and survival is currency, Hellbound asks whether legacy is something you escape\u2026 or something you pass on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MEET THE CAST!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/1416ebe16146534663bc7e3a03ee428a.avif?t=1768676517\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/5a16dc6aafc3a35d588f06dd2732e305.avif?t=1768676517\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zyne is the leader. Arania is his apprentice. Keanu is his assassin. Moose is his hacker. Mr. Clean is... his drug dealer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They follow Zyne for their own reasons. But when the mask falls, they\u2019ll discover that crime isn't as fun as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/b7d0358bf7a8a0e43ff64cd648d39df4.avif?t=1768676517\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: HELLBOUND is a fictional work intended for mature audiences. It contains depictions of violence, substance use, addiction, and explores complex themes including trauma, identity, queerness, and masculinity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All characters, artwork, and writing are created and owned by SodaFrizz.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To Baratrum City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/87418a2e9481170b23b26b87df57db173b65c004.jpg"},{"name":"Band of Thieves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/893da443581f6c9c895c2b61a5af247b25789bfd.jpg"},{"name":"Bisexual Crimes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/a2dd858afa690461bb37219b4c535b61b18fab0e.jpg"},{"name":"A Gangster And His Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/48a3b01103c18034d748a6b4099b25b979ba0430.jpg"},{"name":"Moose Remembers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/d21c4a43879a1e65e14b77988d2f06e03dfbac86.jpg"},{"name":"Killed A Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/c7c0afe41753cc604921735428c70584d332b15b.jpg"},{"name":"Hellbound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/b24b3bd50e5940e7854054f697fea61701b58f9b.jpg"},{"name":"The Hug of an Assassin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/96b1c11b331652194d9f2115187146c3be385a45.jpg"},{"name":"How To Date A Criminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702810/f4ed91f39b08dd25c4bd10864a9c88211d906f46.jpg"},{"name":"What A Silly Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s